      },
      "message": "fix(xmpp): Use XMPP_CONFIG for domain instead of hardcoded values\n\nInstances were sending messages to coordination.nexus (non-existent)\ninstead of smoothcurves.nexus. This fix:\n\n- Exports XMPP_CONFIG from messaging.js\n- Updates bootstrap.js, introspect.js, joinProject.js to import and\n  use XMPP_CONFIG.domain and XMPP_CONFIG.conference\n- Updates functions.md documentation to reflect correct domain\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
