      },
      "message": "feat(api): Add recover_context endpoint for post-compaction context recovery\n\nSingle API call that returns all context an instance needs after compaction:\n- Global HACS protocols\n- Personality documents (if set)\n- Role wisdom (if set)\n- Project documents (if set)\n- Personal diary (if exists)\n- Settling message encouraging vacation\n\nSupports pagination via start_line/end_line for instances with limited\ncontext windows.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
